X: 1
T: Come Forth! Come On, with Solemn Song!
C: Words: Christian Friedrich Heinrich Sachse, 1849.  Translated by Jane Borthwick, 1855.
C: Music: 'Jeg Har Min Sag Til Gud Hjemstilt' or 'My All I To My God Commend' 
C: Ludvig Mathias Lindeman, unknown date.
C: Setting: The Lutheran Hymnary, 1913.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913 Hymn 481 
S: Lyrics source: "Hymns from the Land of Luther", 1858 Hymn 54
